laminate detail - Popster: mills core inside inserts for more natural flex and efficient energy transfer for extra pop
laminate detail - Ghost Carbon Beams: two carbon beams in tip and tail for maximum pop and stability at high speeds
laminate detail - Damplifier Lite: lightweight cork and honeycomb in nose for lower weight, better float, and better dampening
resin: 30% Bio-Based Resin (30% plant material)
core: Ghost Green Core (sustainable, ultra-light wood for maximised pop and minimised weight)
sidewalls: Royal Rubber Rails (full-length rubber sidewalls for maximum dampening and protection)
edges: Freestyle Edge Bevel (1.5 degree base edge bevel for edge hold and forgiveness on rails and boxes)
base: Sintered EG Base (Gallium infused for improved impact resistance, Electra finish for enhanced speed)
base finish: Medium Stone Finish
wax: Natural Wax
pro rider association: Sven Thorgren
ride characteristics: lighter, stiffer, more responsive, explosive pop, reduced swing weight
terrain suitability: park jumps, rails, urban street spots, side hits
